1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,463
Zero resistance is only half the story.

2
00:00:03,463 --> 00:00:09,778
In nineteen thirty three, Meissner found that a superconductor also expels magnetic field.

3
00:00:09,778 --> 00:00:14,127
Above T c, field lines pass straight through the material.

4
00:00:14,127 --> 00:00:18,424
Cool it below T c, and the field is pushed out completely.

5
00:00:18,424 --> 00:00:20,130
B is zero inside.

6
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:21,953
That is the Meissner effect.

